kávy v Jeseníku.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "9e06215", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "59bc365", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "02", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "a13025d", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Nabídka zdarma", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "3de9b82", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Dostanete jasnou cenu, rozsah a termín. Bez skrytých položek.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "02cc693", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "eb591a3", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "03", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "cd8f4e7", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Struktura webu", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "2c08a1a", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Navrhneme, jaké stránky web potřebuje a jak po nich návštěvník dojde k poptávce.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "fa41749", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "b5274a0", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "04", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "5df8d0c", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Obsah", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "2d08b7c", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Pomůžeme s texty, které prodávají a zároveň dobře fungují ve vyhledávačích.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "573537b", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "9849c3a", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "05", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "d892630", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Design", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "4caf44b", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Grafický návrh v duchu vaší značky. Připomínkujete, dokud nejste spokojení.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "2e3ee48", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "da5a6c0", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "06", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "2e25573", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Realizace", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "81d092f", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Web postavíme na WordPressu s Elementorem, u individuálních projektů na October CMS.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "c12ae43", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "aad5ed8", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "07", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "090a8c4", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Spuštění", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "b7fe78e", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Doména, hosting, SSL, Analytics, Search Console a kontrola všech formulářů.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "3903473", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "7f6df18", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "08", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "0dfd206", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Péče po spuštění", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "1aa0b0d", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Aktualizace, zálohy, úpravy a další rozvoj webu podle výsledků.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}]}, {"id": "7468473", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-light", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "detail"}, "elements": [{"id": "f27a407", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ww-legal-wrap ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "f7ff5a7", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Proč tvorba webu na míru místo šablony", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2s"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "06d5938", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Web z online stavebnice vypadá podobně jako tisíce dalších a často naráží na limity – v SEO, ve vlastnictví dat i v možnostech dalšího rozvoje. Tvorba webu na míru znamená, že strukturu, texty i design přizpůsobíme vašemu oboru a zákazníkům.</p><h3>Web, který si upravíte sami</h3><p>Stavíme převážně na WordPressu a Elementoru. Texty, fotky, ceník nebo novou stránku změníte sami bez programátora. Ukážeme vám, jak na to, a když budete chtít, úpravy převezmeme.</p><h3>SEO od prvního dne</h3><p>Každá stránka má promyšlené nadpisy, popisky, interní odkazy a strukturovaná data. Web tak má od začátku šanci ukázat se lidem, kteří hledají vaše služby na Googlu.</p><h3>Pro klienty z celé České republiky</h3><p>Sídlíme v Jeseníku, ale tvorba webových stránek u nás není vázaná na region. Pracujeme pro klienty z Olomouckého, Moravskoslezského i Pardubického kraje a z celého Česka.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-legaltext"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "b67251a", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-light", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "reference"}, "elements": [{"id": "9fd8567", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "d85c027", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-head ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "861826f", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "9017a6d", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Reference", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-eyebrow"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "00d6142", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Weby, na které jsme hrdí.", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "0f9436b", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Výběr realizací. Celé portfolio webů, e-shopů a kampaní najdete na Yesmark.eu.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-muted ww-lead"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "b830d72", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-refs", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "4cab199", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "f767167", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-top", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "bafdf98", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"image": {"id": 28, "url": "https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-konradt-web.jpg", "alt": "Reference: web Konradt", "source": "library"}, "image_size": "large", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-shot"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "ac67cb0", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<span class=\"ww-ref-hint\">Projeďte web ↓</span>", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-hintw"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "b965d01", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-body", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "b1a459d", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Web · CNC obrábění", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-tag"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "06d3673", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Konradt", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "de29b9a", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Pro společnost KONRADT jsme vytvořili nové webové stránky zaměřené na profesionální prezentaci služeb v oblasti CNC obrábění, montáže a zpracování kovů. Při realizaci jsme kladli důraz na moderní technický vzhled, přehledné představení výrobních možností společnosti a srozumitelnou prezentaci jednotlivých služeb.</p><p>Součástí realizace byla také optimalizace struktury a obsahu webu s ohledem na vyhledávače a lepší dohledatelnost služeb v oblasti CNC frézování, CNC soustružení, montážních prací a dodávek odlitků.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "a34fea4", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "konradt.cz", "link": {"url": "https://www.konradt.cz/", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--plain ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "97d3606", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "d257ec4", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-top", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "d70cb9e", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"image": {"id": 29, "url": "https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-monika-velickova-web.jpg", "alt": "Reference: web Monika Veličková", "source": "library"}, "image_size": "large", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-shot"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "e586975", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<span class=\"ww-ref-hint\">Projeďte web ↓</span>", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-hintw"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "c164917", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-body", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "5a0d7af", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Web · Reality Jeseníky", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-tag"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "6438459", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Monika Veličková", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "f23c0fb", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Pro realitní makléřku Moniku Veličkovou jsme vytvořili nové webové stránky zaměřené na prezentaci nemovitostí a realitních služeb v Jeseníkách. Při realizaci jsme kladli důraz na moderní a osobitý design, přehlednou prezentaci nabízených nemovitostí a především na budování osobní značky, která staví na znalosti regionu, individuálním přístupu a zkušenostech s realitami i investicemi.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "4f1f7ee", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "monikavelickova.cz", "link": {"url": "https://monikavelickova.cz/", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--plain ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "6ee73d1", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "d0064bf", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-top", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "7f70028", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"image": {"id": 27, "url": "https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-brincil-web.jpg", "alt": "Reference: web Břinčil", "source": "library"}, "image_size": "large", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-shot"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "ce1e5f5", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<span class=\"ww-ref-hint\">Projeďte web ↓</span>", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-hintw"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "8813f04", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-body", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "5f63e69", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Web · Technika a služby", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-tag"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "189d7a4", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Břinčil", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "acf1db7", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Při realizaci webu pro firmu Břinčil jsme kladli důraz na moderní a přehledný design, snadnou orientaci návštěvníků a kvalitní prezentaci společnosti i její techniky. Nový web zároveň slouží jako podpůrná prezentace hlavní společnosti Břinčil &amp; Míka s.r.o., pro kterou jsme v minulosti rovněž realizovali kompletní online prezentaci.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "8a48ba7", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "brincil.cz", "link": {"url": "https://brincil.cz/", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--plain ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}, {"id": "1631122", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-row ww-refs-more ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "54cb760", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Další weby, e-shopy a kampaně najdete v portfoliu Yesmark.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-muted"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "afc0e4e", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "Všechny reference", "link": {"url": "https://yesmark.eu/reference/?utm_source=wwwwww.cz&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=wwwwww_reference&utm_content=homepage_all", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--dark ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}, {"id": "91ce668", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-dark", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "cenik"}, "elements": [{"id": "e9fc655", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ww-price", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "59bad7b", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-price-card ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "fc5d1bc", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Cena", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-eyebrow"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "4e0b49b", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "<small>Tvorba webových stránek</small>od 9 900 Kč", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-price-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "a6595f9", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Konečná cena záleží na rozsahu, funkcích a grafice. Nabídku vám připravíme zdarma a nezávazně.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-muted"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "e0174e2", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-row", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "f82129f", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "Chci cenovou nabídku", "link": {"url": "#poptavka", "is_external": "", "nofollow": ""}}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "0ffe382", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "653d266", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Časté otázky – tvorba webových stránek", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2s"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "f750883", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "toggle", "settings": {"faq_schema": "yes", "tabs": [{"_id": "434ffb7", "tab_title": "Kolik stojí tvorba webových stránek?", "tab_content": "<p>Tvorba webových stránek začíná na 9 900 Kč. Cena záleží na počtu stránek, funkcích a grafickém zpracování. Podrobnosti najdete na stránce <a href=\"/kolik-stoji-web/\">Kolik stojí web</a>.</p>"}, {"_id": "e93a4aa", "tab_title": "Jak dlouho trvá tvorba webu?", "tab_content": "<p>Jednodušší prezentační web bývá hotový za 2–4 týdny, rozsáhlejší web nebo e-shop za 4–8 týdnů. Přesný harmonogram dostanete v nabídce.</p>"}, {"_id": "32026c8", "tab_title": "Co od vás budete potřebovat?", "tab_content": "<p>Hlavně informace o vašich službách, logo a ideálně vlastní fotky. S texty rádi pomůžeme.</p>"}, {"_id": "6a1a50c", "tab_title": "Na jakém systému web postavíte?", "tab_content": "<p>Nejčastěji na WordPressu s Elementorem, u individuálních projektů na October CMS. Web je vždy ve vašem vlastnictví.</p>"}, {"_id": "023ddfd", "tab_title": "Pomůžete s doménou a hostingem?", "tab_content": "<p>Ano. Doménu i hosting zařídíme, nebo web napojíme na ty, které už máte.</p>"}], "_css_classes": "ww-faq"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}, {"id": "9e5b2d8", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-light", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "poptavka"}, "elements": [{"id": "4a194fc", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "00bf362", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-head ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "378a73e", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "6cd57b9", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "se